{
  "_description": "llama3 fixture: 3-exchange multi-turn (text-only). Exercises inter-turn header markers and that every assistant turn is supervised. L1 parity vs jinja (existing parity test), L2 may diverge only at trailer. Golden snapshot for n_tokens.",
